{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019NcfE1k2SaoKBgDxUej5Lk","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_2/projects/entrainment_gated_ft/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-19\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp-003** (negative): Architecture-specific helped/hurt samples on LAMBADA differ in surface features (token frequency, context length, lexical complexity), AND these feature profiles differ across GDN/HGRN2/RetNet — indicating architecture-specific mechanisms rather than generic attention benefit\\\\n  [sample_characterization_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/entrainment_gated_ft/artifacts/exp-003/data/sample_characterization_results.csv) | [sample_characterization_figure](/api/workspace-files/projects/entrainment_gated_ft/artifacts/exp-003/chart/sample_characterization_figure_pointer.txt)\\\\n- **exp-001** (success): Cross-architecture variance (std) on retrieval-dependent tasks decreases monotonically with attention ratio at 1.3B scale, while reasoning-dependent tasks show no convergence — establishing task-specificity as a principled feature of the equalizer effect, not a limitation\\\\n  [task_specificity_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/entrainment_gated_ft/artifacts/exp-001/data/task_specificity_results.csv) | [task_specificity_figure](/api/workspace-files/projects/entrainment_gated_ft/artifacts/exp-001/chart/task_specificity_figure_info.txt)\\\\n- **exp-009** (success): Our equalizer effect analysis provides fully novel contributions relative to Wang et al. (arXiv 2507.06457) across 4 dimensions: convergence quantification (Spearman ρ + permutation test vs qualitative observation), scale dependency (quantitative 1.3B vs 340M contrast vs binary statement), per-example mechanism (Jaccard + net effect analysis vs absent), and task-specificity (convergence-strength by task type vs ratio-sensitivity)\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 4 / 负向 1 / 失败 0 / 共 6\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestb-48145: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- hgrn2_eval_1_3b_all: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1867, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01D7ERW48s8wvxuAcSkcwTyq","session_id":"754c51f8-c396-47ec-abd3-50c7df01afbd","uuid":"5fb196f7-40dd-4e6b-b52b-d061dc472fa1","timestamp":"2026-05-19T13:42:43.525Z"}
